{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：21:30 2026-11-16 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"玫瑰戰爭｜鄺潔楹接客激吻纏綿畫面逐格睇  迷離眼神肉搏浴袍男  被拍援交影片陷絕境\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ee31fe8c2c8d86901282249c96f1c728/2026-11/ENT___42.jpg\"/>\n<p>TVB台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》自開播以來劇情高潮迭起。繼早前陳自瑤在劇中被迷姦的片段引發熱話後，今晚（16日）播出的最新一集再度成為焦點。劇中飾演「林安安」的鄺潔楹（Judy）迎來入行以來最大尺度的突破演出，一場「接客援交」的戲份相當大膽，隨即在網上掀起熱烈討論。</p>\n<h2>鄺潔楹挑戰大尺度激情戲</h2>\n<p>今集劇情講述楊茜堯合力尋找殺害陳自瑤的真兇，期間得悉鄺潔楹借高利貸，並在外面從事援交。楊茜堯為求取得把柄，指使吳沚默利用無人機高空偷拍。身穿粉色性感吊帶睡衣的鄺潔楹，與身穿白色浴袍的男客人在電視櫃旁親熱。隨後，男客人在微弱燈光下將鄺潔楹整個人抱起，兩人一邊親吻，一邊移步至床邊及溫泉池旁。男方接著脫去浴袍，赤裸上身與鄺潔楹在露台邊和床上纏綿，更親吻鄺潔楹的頸部與香肩，並扯下其睡衣肩帶，畫面尺度非常大，引人遐想。</p>\n<img alt=\"騰訊視頻、極光TV全網提早在11月6日首播，TVB將於11月9日首播。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/738d16287e6df385e6ec547cb2685a6b/2026-11/001_1_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹於劇中演惡毒的林安安。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ba9eecd78a8560ceab019617d3e46ce/2026-11/001_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹新劇《玫瑰戰爭》中表面天真無害，實質心機極重。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/16f11ea2d99f95c0ce50e2e243b07215/2026-11/VS--1--myTVSUPER-15_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹（右）與劇中一眾姊妹表面和睦，背後卻暗藏殺機。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f9288f4bf28fcfcc0444d1187b42e60/2026-11/VS--1--myTVSUPER-15_45_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹展現招牌甜美笑容，完美演繹笑面虎「林安安」一角。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b11bb52c793d87a1cb9032f5712b08ce/2026-11/VS--1--myTVSUPER-17_55_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹飾演的林安安外出接客。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/397caf2a912bd5fcfd2cf968b0c27d17/2026-11/1_4_79.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹穿上肉色吊帶短裙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/578793ada602dab36af84b64f47a070f/2026-11/2_3_32.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹任由身材高大的「男客人」擺佈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e1fc54e050f78f2e4072958f55070f92/2026-11/3_0_36.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹眼神迷離。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1bc0c487f1477e2cb5f1d49bf0b49db8/2026-11/4_7_23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹被攬實狂錫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f51c776969c8a65556e067b6d0e3927c/2026-11/5_0_49.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹一臉享受。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b3f12429538c2ca2fefa713eef0bc002/2026-11/6_2_16.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹被抱起。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afaef949f0033804a3b4ac84582ae3c0/2026-11/7_2_35.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹眼神迷離。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3d9e7f5d7741ef9bd81898abfa832eab/2026-11/8_1_29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹跟男客人埋身肉搏。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0e05ff4a98c830445911221d1d011f38/2026-11/9_1_23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹被抬得老高。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/acd4fca6b3d735287b9d54867e173072/2026-11/10_0_34.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹被親雪白頸項。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ffec27ba2fcdd7ccc1fbc6e9b6b20298/2026-11/11_1_32.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹演得放。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a90ab63ee640a5226ffe78b44f6d56b6/2026-11/12_32.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄺潔楹接客過程被全面偷拍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0b2005ec81c2b3e20196904992bc5a34/2026-11/13_0_21.jpg\"/>\n<h2>鄺潔楹演活吸毒妹神智不清</h2>\n<p>除了尺度突破外，鄺潔楹這次的演技亦備受讚賞。劇中的「林安安」備受毒癮折磨，在接客過程中，她因受到藥物影響，眼神顯得極度迷離空洞、四肢癱軟，任由男客人擁抱親吻。她將一個神智不清、墮入深淵的失足少女演得非常傳神，贏得網民一致好評。</p>\n<h2>鄺潔楹被要挾供出姚子羚</h2>\n<p>這段露骨的援交影片被吳沚默拍下後，楊茜堯幕後指使將影片匿名傳送給經理人陳豪，導致鄺潔楹即時慘遭解約。正當鄺潔楹陷入絕境之際，楊茜堯現身表示自己花費五萬元買下該影片，令鄺潔楹一度誤以為對方是救命恩人。楊茜堯表面上歸還影片示好，實際上卻以此作要挾，逼迫鄺潔楹交代陳自瑤遇害的真相。在雙重打擊下，鄺潔楹終於崩潰，一邊痛哭一邊承認當年是自己親手將下了藥的酒遞給陳自瑤，而背後的幕後黑手，正是當年逼迫陳自瑤到DM28接客的金牌經理人姚子羚。</p>\n<h2>玫瑰戰爭丨陳自瑤慘遭出賣被迷姦？</h2>\n<img alt=\"「梁菲雅」傅嘉莉疑暗戀「李德龍」馬國明。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a8c1f07c5d9aab95e503f50dcfa0d5da/2026-11/TVB_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「梁菲雅」傅嘉莉疑視「關子盈」陳自瑤為情敵。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d271f7b0ff9451c7370597ca5132ea9/2026-11/Drama_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「梁菲雅」傅嘉莉借拍攝之便，報復「關子盈」陳自瑤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/40566887f07d6d7beb154321b795e42a/2026-11/Drama_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「梁菲雅」傅嘉莉借拍攝之便，多度向「關子盈」陳自瑤掌摑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/163d95315827183bbb7d98a3a75bab5a/2026-11/Drama_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「關子盈」陳自瑤被打到跌親。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/88f06af9e363ff03e3c5d9a85ec4a89a/2026-11/Drama_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「志邦」莫家淦為「梁菲雅」傅嘉莉辦事。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/72c1a3400843981870e557c04a8fff2d/2026-11/Drama_49_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有婦之夫「志邦」莫家淦陷害影后「關子盈」陳自瑤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/57087501c6565b9822ab68ad216c70f9/2026-11/TVB_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳自瑤捲入醜聞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/23051b041c37cdebeaca9e7de2a7c400/2026-11/TVB_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「關子盈」陳自瑤經理人「藍鳳儀」姚子羚向老闆「陳雲生」陳豪報告。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f58911e78300f62c2d0eef3509b964b/2026-11/Drama_66_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「陳雲生」陳豪維護「關子盈」陳自瑤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7a5b10f156b86ecf8b85ec6e420317f6/2026-11/Drama_68_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「藍鳳儀」姚子羚搵「林安安」鄺潔楹設局，摧毀「關子盈」陳自瑤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7a4b3785f581574b5b9177c7393d509e/2026-11/Drama_74_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「關子盈」陳自瑤沒有防備「藍鳳儀」姚子羚與「林安安」鄺潔楹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aefcee9a1a60a7c126f9cb921a942655/2026-11/Drama_82_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「林安安」鄺潔楹在酒中落藥。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/878d90006eee761f0993c0122627905d/2026-11/Drama_87_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《玫瑰戰爭》第4集中出現「迷姦水」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f49e91b8c6924f24b026386d3cc1d83/2026-11/Drama_90_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳自瑤毫無防備中招。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a2a312e3e578bbffaa4ee495ba10f563/2026-11/Drama_105_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳自瑤喝下加料酒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d34b4d867dc24e7c8d0c3b9c14d10e59/2026-11/Drama_116_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳自瑤隨即神志不清。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6e62a6845f857348505be2229ade2893/2026-11/Drama_136_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳自瑤曾到洗手間自救。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/518a98d1f926558bdbeded2286e7a041/2026-11/Drama_146_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚子羚尋陳自瑤誘對方上房。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b1e03de93666f68db217b3a1dc8c0dfc/2026-11/Drama_151_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳自瑤事後發現被迷姦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ee26b2d92e8652594ee83e208acf26fb/2026-11/Drama_179_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳自瑤回想起經過。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e6a1c605732200534bc355b6ee950b51/2026-11/Drama_192_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳自瑤憶起被迷姦過程。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/09c7b3129c53d59886a1ca71d97bd993/2026-11/VS-----23_50_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳自瑤完全沒有意識。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e77c7dc6922dcc12a3c7a4d8286d0143/2026-11/VS-----23_52_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳自瑤無法反抗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7702b8b162c6e2c566cbf8644ab2e73e/2026-11/VS-----23_53_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳自瑤被好友陷害。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/066336474569d25c5266f4083fa70b57/2026-11/VS-----23_57_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳自瑤被送上房陪客。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6801ad8a19684ab52d5d08d07eac295f/2026-11/VS-----23_59_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳自瑤情緒崩潰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/21b3f4811796aad27abe888cdedb94a2/2026-11/Drama_200_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳自瑤打電話質問姚子羚是否落藥。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/db8a76218a6f21290cbb8d4088350d4c/2026-11/Drama_205_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳自瑤與姚子羚對質。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9e4c0dbca461eb257961bd93a4ad0151/2026-11/Drama_206_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳自瑤被送到客戶的床上。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a44b2ab8191d83b96c13924dab083b2/2026-11/Drama_208_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳自瑤仲被偷拍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27d62280285332d1977faf9878c83fac/2026-11/Drama_214_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳自瑤因被落藥，失去抵抗能力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f3a6f308a4f20ecce4e052239f03ca41/2026-11/Drama_217_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「關子盈」陳自瑤與「夏無雙」楊茜堯、「藍鳳儀」姚子羚、「黎綺雲」林夏薇、「林安安」鄺潔楹、「梁菲雅」傅嘉莉，原是朋友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/33ef321d975ebcadbbd6543701e2bb87/2026-11/Drama_229_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T13:38:30.293989+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":746,"images":52,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T13:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T15:33:23.110262+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T13:32:03.002320+00:00","content_hash":"3fe3e6e05da8377f6fed04bed1d16017cf132bd07bf9c1097cafc19e32ab02e3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}